<mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Steps&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6c8ebf&quot;&gt;User or agent prompt&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Carries the caller's own identity.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6c8ebf&quot;&gt;Copilot / agent / AI app&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;No separate identity — assumes the caller's ACLs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#d79b00&quot;&gt;Grounding data&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;SharePoint, OneDrive, Teams content.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;4. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#d6b656&quot;&gt;Labels, DLP, access checks&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Query-time gate — every result re-checked here.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;5. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#82b366&quot;&gt;Response&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Only gate-approved content reaches the answer.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;6. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9673a6&quot;&gt;Unified audit log&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every interaction is recorded as CopilotInteraction.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;7. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b85450&quot;&gt;DSPM for AI activity explorer&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Risk view over AI interactions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;8. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b85450&quot;&gt;Retention and eDiscovery&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Legal hold and investigation over the same log.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1560" y="150" width="320" height="620" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
